[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339750183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110931#issuecomment-3339750183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110931","id":3339750183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HEIsn","user":{"login":"Jojo-1000","id":33495614,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDk1NjE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33495614?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000","html_url":"https://github.com/Jojo-1000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T17:26:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T17:26:21Z","body":"I can reproduce this. The issue is that you cannot set import settings before it tries to actually import the csv as translations.\nFor now you can right click and select \"Reimport\", this should open the import settings (on the left next to the \"Scene\" tab) and you can then choose \"Keep File\" and reimport (I assume you want to have access to the file in an exported game).\n\n<img width=\"267\" height=\"622\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47ccbaf7-39b5-486e-873b-38c8e8128e7a\" />\n\nAfter this, there should no longer be errors when you double click it but instead an error popup that you cannot open it.\nYou can then edit it in the Scripts text editor by opening it manually using the \"File\" menu (change the file filter to .* to see it).\n\nThere is this open PR to open csv files directly: #110323\n\nA few other issues: #94818, #110311\n\nI would maybe like it if there was a way to select \"CSV Data\" as the resource type instead of only translations","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339750183/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342037477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110931#issuecomment-3342037477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110931","id":3342037477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HM3Hl","user":{"login":"m-irigoyen","id":9933144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMxNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9933144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen","html_url":"https://github.com/m-irigoyen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-irigoyen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T20:47:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T20:47:58Z","body":"Indeed, keeping the file imported without the translations is what I was going for. Can confirm this works, thank you !\n\nIt's an annoyance to have to delete all those fake translation files at import time, especially if the imported CSV is column-heavy. But that can wait for a QOL pass.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342037477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342077624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110931#issuecomment-3342077624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110931","id":3342077624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HNA64","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T22:10:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T22:10:05Z","body":"Thanks for the report! Consolidating in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110311.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"ht